    "text": "By Jasper Whitmore ,\n21 hours ago Atlanta might be famous for its Southern soul food and barbecue, but tucked between the peach trees are some incredible French restaurants that transport you straight to Paris. Whether you crave buttery croissants, rich coq au vin, or elegant French wines, these spots deliver authentic flavors without the overseas flight.... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
